ok the float value
ok AsBoolean
ok the boolean value
ok AsDateTime
ok the date-time value
ok AsBytes
ok the bytes
ok Clear: null, bound, the type stays
ok cleared
ok Bound can be reset
ok Clear binds an unbound parameter
